# Getting Started

We write open source computer programs in areas of knowledge, healthcare and self-development.

What we can do: build applications that run on mobile, desktop and web.

## Usage Notes

- Press `s` keyboard button to search across all pages
- Use the arrow keys to navigate to the next (`→`) and previous (`←`) page

